  "translation": "And what the king saw: a watcher and a holy one descending from the heavens and saying, 'Cut down the tree and destroy it, but leave the stump of its roots in the earth, in a band of iron and bronze, in the grass of the field; and with the dew of the heavens let it be wet, and with the beasts of the field ⟨be⟩ its portion, until seven times pass over him.'",
